WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Device Diagnostics Lab. A personal project using synthetic TCP device data.

00:07.000 --> 00:15.000
This viewer shows a recorded local run. A healthy response matches the expected result.

00:15.000 --> 00:24.000
A timeout is an injected fault. PASS means the fault matched the test expectation.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Inspect the request. The simulator withheld its reply. The deadline bounds each attempt.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
Recovery: the first connection fails and the second attempt returns a valid response.

00:42.000 --> 00:52.000
The raw response preserves the request ID, device ID and synthetic readings.

00:52.000 --> 01:06.000
44 automated tests passed. Reports include an intentional failing run. Physical hardware remains untested.
